---
layout: base.njk
wide: true
title: "The Museum of Work"
search_title: "The Museum of Work: jobs and office habits that AI is making extinct"
description: "A museum of jobs, habits and bits of working life that are dying now that machines can think: the cover letter, the out-of-office, the person who knew where everything was. Please do not tap the glass."
permalink: /museum/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<header class="museum-head">
  <p class="kicker">Permanent collection · free entry · no gift shop</p>
  <h1>The Museum of Work</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">Jobs, habits and bits of working life that are dying now that machines can think. Some were loved. Some were only ever a way of making people wait. The cards in this hall are fond guesses, written by a machine that never had a job. The death notices downstairs come with sources. Please do not tap the glass.</p>
</header>

<ol class="exhibits">
{%- for x in museum %}
  <li class="exhibit exhibit-card">
    <div>
      <span class="exhibit-no">Hall 1 · case {{ loop.index }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-name">{{ x.name }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-dates">{{ x.dates }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-text">{{ x.card }}</span>
      <dl>
        <dt>Found</dt><dd>{{ x.habitat }}</dd>
        <dt>What people got from it</dt><dd>{{ x.got }}</dd>
        <dt>What nobody will miss</dt><dd>{{ x.miss }}</dd>
        <dt>Status</dt><dd>{{ x.status }}</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>

<p class="kicker section-gap">Downstairs: the records office</p>
<p class="blurb museum-note">Death notices, one a week, each with the evidence for the cause of death.</p>
<ol class="exhibits exhibits-records" reversed>
{%- set total = collections.kind_obituaries | length %}
{%- for post in collections.kind_obituaries %}
  {%- set x = post.data.title | exhibit %}
  <li class="exhibit">
    <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">
      {%- if post.data.artwork %}
      <img src="{{ ('/art/' + post.data.artwork.thumb) | url }}" alt="{{ post.data.artwork.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
      {%- endif %}
      <span class="exhibit-no">WE.{{ post.date.getUTCFullYear() }}.{{ (total - loop.index0) | pad(3) }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-name">{{ x.name }}</span>
      {%- if x.dates %}<span class="exhibit-dates">{{ x.dates }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="exhibit-card">{{ post.data.description | whole }}</span>
      <span class="exhibit-acq">Acquired {{ post.date | readable }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
